{"last_link_id": 14, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["参考音频文案，要求一样！"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [210, 88], "pos": [-2554.703369140625, -578.2223510742188], "id": 9, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [14], "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-2282.767822265625, -886.0404052734375], "widgets_values": ["大师兄呀，唔好喇！师父俾隻衰妖捉咗去呀！嗰隻妖係乜嚟㗎？青面獠牙，仲有條長長嘅舌頭，嚇到我豬膽都震埋！我舉起釘耙想打佢，點知隻腳軟到似糯米糍，一嘢跌低嗰陣，連釘耙都甩咗飛去隔籬山！師父俾人綁住喺樹上面，喊住：『八戒救我！』我救你？我連自己都救唔掂呀！你快啲踩你嗰朵筋斗雲，揮你條金箍棒去篤佢兩篤啦！再遲啲，師父就變咗妖嘅點心，清蒸定油炸都唔知呀！我肚仔咕咕聲，等你打完妖，返去齋菜都凍晒喇！快啲啦，猴哥，我對腳都軟到似豆腐花喇！"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "id": 8, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["提示词"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [210, 88], "pos": [-2562.2197265625, -854.30224609375], "id": 10, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "AUDIO", "links": [12], "label": "AUDIO", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "AUDIO"}], "size": [350.4437255859375, 136], "pos": [-2251.99462890625, -1132.56103515625], "widgets_values": ["339419917b5b8ac6a1204812c3a19a24689a6e062018ae87acd260001d394283.FLAC", null, null], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "audio"}, "name": "audio", "label": "audio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "label": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "audioUI"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "AUDIOUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "id": 2, "type": "LoadAudio", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.52", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"upload": true, "audio": true, "audioUI": true}, "version": "7.0.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadAudio"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [13], "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-2284.464599609375, -582.4535522460938], "widgets_values": ["大师兄呀，唔好喇！师父俾隻衰妖捉咗去呀！嗰隻妖係乜嚟㗎？青面獠牙，仲有條長長嘅舌頭，嚇到我豬膽都震埋！我舉起釘耙想打佢，點知隻腳軟到似糯米糍，一嘢跌低嗰陣，連釘耙都甩咗飛去隔籬山！"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "id": 7, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["## 🎤 Achieving High-Quality Voice Clones\n\nTo achieve the best voice cloning results, providing an accurate `prompt_text` is **critical**. This text acts as a transcript that aligns the sound of the `prompt_audio` with the words being spoken, teaching the model the speaker's unique vocal characteristics.\n\n### How to Use `prompt_text` Effectively\n\n#### 1. **Provide a Verbatim Transcript**\nThe `prompt_text` must be a word-for-word transcript of the `prompt_audio`. Do not summarize or describe the audio.\n\n✅ **Correct:** `The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog.`\n\n❌ **Incorrect:** `A person saying a sentence about a fox.`\n\n#### 2. **Punctuation is Important**\nUse accurate punctuation to capture the speaker's intonation. The model learns how the speaker ends sentences, asks questions, or shows excitement.\n\n-   **For a statement:** `This is a great example.`\n-   **For a question:** `Is this a great example?`\n-   **For excitement:** `This is a great example!`\n\n#### 3. **Match Audio and Text Length**\nThe audio clip should be long enough to capture the speaker's natural pacing and rhythm.\n\n👍 **Good:** A 5-15 second clip of continuous, clear speech.\n\n👌 **Okay:** A 3-5 second clip.\n\n⚠️ **Warning:** Very short clips (< 3 seconds) may result in a less stable or robotic-sounding clone.\n\n\n> **Note:**\n> For the best results, use a clean, high-quality `prompt_audio` with minimal background noise, reverb, or music. The model will try to clone the *entire* acoustic environment, not just the voice."], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [360.7866516113281, 348.9750061035156], "pos": [-1853.7724609375, -1087.5966796875], "id": 6, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [396.5276794433594, 193.39329528808594], "pos": [-998.1849975585938, -1062.38330078125], "widgets_values": ["audio/VoxCPM"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 10, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "label": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "audioUI"}], "flags": {}, "id": 1, "type": "SaveAudio", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.52", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"filename_prefix": true, "audioUI": true}, "version": "7.0.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveAudio"}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": ["# ComfyUI-VoxCPM\n\n**VoxCPM**  a novel tokenizer-free TTS system for context-aware speech generation and true-to-life voice cloning.\n\n## Models\nThis node automatically downloads the required model files.\n\n| Model | Parameters | Hugging Face Link |\n|:---|:---:|:---|\n| VoxCPM-0.5B | 0.5B | [openbmb/VoxCPM-0.5B](https://huggingface.co/openbmb/VoxCPM-0.5B) |\n\n## Support \n\n- Don't know how to update PyTorch?\n- Need help with ComfyUI?\n- Need technical support?\n\n### Or do you just have questions? Then join the [@TokenDiffusion Hub](https://t.me/TokenDiff_hub) group\n\n### AI news [TokenDiffusion](https://t.me/TokenDiff)"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [311.074462890625, 346.9256286621094], "pos": [-916.9237060546875, -786.6041870117188], "id": 4, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [{"name": "Generated Audio", "links": [10], "label": "Generated Audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "Generated Audio"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["VoxCPM1.5", "哎呀，大师兄，不好咯！师父又遭妖怪抓起跑咯！这回是哪个批妖孽哦，黑黢黢的一坨，扛着师父‘嗖’一下就没得影儿咯！我追得屁儿翻天，结果一跟头栽到田头，啃了一嘴泥巴！师父在那儿喊：‘八戒救我！’我救个铲铲哦，我自身都难保！你还不赶紧翻你的筋斗云，拿你的金箍棒，去给他两坨子！再慢点，师父就要被蒸起、煮起、红烧起咯！老子肚皮都饿扁咯，还等你打妖妖，打完回去吃斋饭！快点儿哦，猴哥，我屁儿都冒烟咯！", 2, 10, true, 779450847354055, "fixed", false, "cuda", 3, 6, ""], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "prompt_audio", "link": 12, "label": "prompt_audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "prompt_audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "model_name"}, "name": "model_name", "label": "model_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 14, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"widget": {"name": "cfg_value"}, "name": "cfg_value", "label": "cfg_value", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "cfg_value"}, {"widget": {"name": "inference_timesteps"}, "name": "inference_timesteps", "label": "inference_timesteps", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "inference_timesteps"}, {"widget": {"name": "normalize_text"}, "name": "normalize_text", "label": "normalize_text", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "normalize_text"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name":